#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/pages/Design.tsx
msgid "design.why.1"
msgstr "Halfway through the accounting course, I noticed that what stayed with me was not which account goes where, but the way the teacher told the story of one small company from beginning to end: money comes in to set it up, a computer is bought, a batch of goods arrives, it is sold, the company borrows, then pays it back. The three statements grew slowly out of these small things."

